  "releaseNotes": "Vali-Schedule v1.1.0 — add CronSchedule (5-field cron expression support), SkipWeekends/SkipHolidays with HolidaySkipStrategy, and OccurrencePeriods. Add net10.0 target. No breaking changes.\n\n            Vali-Schedule v1.0.0 — initial release: ValiSchedule fluent builder with Every, On, At, StartingFrom, EndsAfter, EndsOn, WithCustomPredicate; NextOccurrence, PreviousOccurrence, OccursOn, Occurrences, OccurrencesInRange.",
